        <title>ESP32 — Hello World（芯片信息打印 &#43; FreeRTOS 入门）</title>
        <link>https://clingyang.github.io/p/esp32-hello-world%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0--freertos-%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8/</link>
